 / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / 8-bit bytes                                    NAXIS   =                    2 / 2-dimensional binary table                     NAXIS1  =                   16 / width of table in bytes                        NAXIS2  =                    1 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                    0 / size of special data area                      GCOUNT  =                    1 / one data group (required keyword)              TFIELDS =                    2 / number of fields in each row                   TTYPE1  = 'START   '           / label for field   1                            TFORM1  = '1D      '           / data format of field: 8-byte DOUBLE            TUNIT1  = 's       '           / physical unit of field                         TTYPE2  = 'STOP    '           / label for field   2                            TFORM2  = '1D      '           / data format of field: 8-byte DOUBLE            TUNIT2  = 's       '           / physical unit of field                         EXTNAME = 'GTI     '           / name of this binary table extension            HDUCLASS= 'GADF    '           / Signal conformance with HEASARC/OGIP conventionHDUDOC  = 'https://github.com/open-gamma-ray-astro/gamma-astro-data-formats' / RHDUVERS = '0.2     '           / Version of the format                          HDUCLAS1= 'GTI     '           / Primary extension class                        MJDREFI =                52706 / int part of reference MJD [days]               MJDREFF =                   0. / fractional part of reference MJD [days]        TIMEUNIT= 's       '           / time unit is seconds since MET start           TIMESYS = 'utc     '           / time scale is UTC                              TIMEREF = 'local   '           / local time reference                           END                                                                                                           